<!--
    Launcher foreground: the logo by tsubotitsch (images/app-icon.svg) without its background tile and
    the C-ITS wordmark. The paths keep the 512 px coordinates of the logo.

    Bounding circle of the artwork, strokes included: centre (264.5, 236), radius 170.6.
    Across, it reaches from the outer edge of the ring (255.94 - 130 - 64/2 = 93.9; the arc end points
    put the ring centre at 255.94) to the outer signal arc (322 + 104 + 18/2 = 435). Up and down,
    the ring spans 74 to 398. The group moves the centre of that circle to the canvas centre
    (54, 54) and scales it by 0.19 to a radius of 32.4 dp, inside the 33 dp radius of the
    adaptive icon safe zone.
-->
